# axis2 mirror edge-esc-range | pattern: [\x{7f}-\x{80}] | <=U+00FF: BASE-grammar range check compiles under byte too since [M5.0] stage 2 (LIVE pcrec/byte == python/re-bytes)
# pcre2-only
pattern [\x{7f}-\x{80}]
m "\x7f" 0 1
m "\xc2\x80" 1 2
n "0"

# axis2 mirror edge-lit-neg-class | pattern: [^] | LIVE pcrec/byte == python/re-bytes
